### NutriForge API — test all endpoints with VS Code REST Client
### Install extension: humao.rest-client
### Click "Send Request" above each block to test

@base = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

###

### 2. Register a new user
POST {{base}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jawad@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123",
  "name": "Jawad"
}

###

### 3. Login — copy the token from response into @token above
POST {{base}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jawad@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

###

### 4. Save fitness profile
POST {{base}}/users/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "gender": "male",
  "age": 25,
  "weight_kg": 80,
  "height_cm": 180,
  "activity_level": "moderate",
  "goal": "muscle_gain",
  "diet_style": "none",
  "allergies": []
}

###

### 5. Get macro targets
POST {{base}}/nutrition/macros
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "gender": "male",
  "age": 25,
  "weight_kg": 80,
  "height_cm": 180,
  "activity_level": "moderate",
  "goal": "muscle_gain",
  "diet_style": "none",
  "allergies": []
}

###

### 6. Get BMI
GET {{base}}/nutrition/bmi?weight_kg=80&height_cm=180
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 7. Search food (USDA)
POST {{base}}/nutrition/food/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "query": "chicken breast",
  "max_results": 5
}

###

### 8. Get workout plan
POST {{base}}/workout/plan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "profile": {
    "gender": "male",
    "age": 25,
    "weight_kg": 80,
    "height_cm": 180,
    "activity_level": "moderate",
    "goal": "muscle_gain",
    "diet_style": "none",
    "allergies": []
  },
  "request": {
    "sessions_per_week": 4,
    "equipment": "full_gym"
  }
}

###

### 9. Get supplement plan
POST {{base}}/supplements/plan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "gender": "male",
  "age": 25,
  "weight_kg": 80,
  "height_cm": 180,
  "activity_level": "moderate",
  "goal": "muscle_gain",
  "diet_style": "none",
  "allergies": []
}

###

### 10. Log progress
POST {{base}}/progress/log
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "date": "2026-04-22",
  "weight_kg": 80.5,
  "body_fat_pct": 18.2,
  "notes": "Feeling strong this week"
}

###

### 11. Get progress summary
GET {{base}}/progress/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
